===General===
*Just like the original Omnitrix and the Ultimatrix, the Omnitrix mainly allows for the user to alter their DNA at will and transform into a numerous variety of alien species that are each with their own unique powers and abilities (along with their weaknesses) and in a selection of alien DNA that is in groups of 10.    
**Ben compares the feeling of transforming to a "good stretch".<ref name="BiS">''[[Bros in Space]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix has a quick-change feature that allows for the user to transform between alien forms while already transformed with or without touching the Omnitrix symbol. It also allows the user to transform back into normal when they are done using their transformation, causing it not to time out and allowing the user to transform again far quicker.
*Like the original Omnitrix, the Omnitrix has a Master Control mode.
**It can be unlocked by via a special code,<ref name="BWaV">''[[Back With a Vengeance]]''</ref> or voice command by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]].<ref name="WoW1">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]''</ref>
**It would most likely be activated upon Ben's 18th birthday.<ref name="Azmuth">[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]</ref><ref name="TUE2" />
*The Omnitrix can synchronize with another Omnitrix if activated at the same time.<ref>[[Professor Paradox]]</ref><ref name="BA" />
**It is because of this feature that the Omnitrix's [[Hero Watch|counterpart]] from [[Dimension 23]] has unlocked aliens that it did not have previously.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 23 Murk Upchuck.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Omnitrix does not rely on the [[Codon Stream]] for transformations. Instead, the DNA is stored within itself in a computerized form.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Nemetrix contain digitized genetic code.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Omnitrix can change the user's gender to adapt to another species.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Can Change User's Gender.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = gender}}
*The Omnitrix can automatically activate itself to match the user's will. The Omnitrix also has a Slide Off mode for dangerous situations.<ref>''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref>

