*The Omnitrix has a call mode which is used to communicate with the user using the device.
**The Omnitrix can also record messages, similar to voicemail.<ref name="S23">''[[Store 23]]''</ref>
**The Omnitrix has an "emergency mode" for important messages, giving the user a warning shock. The Omnitrix can also block messages (which is overridden by emergency mode).<ref name="MM">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix has the functionalities of a regular digital watch.{{Refn|http://archive.is/Dqqkr|group = DJW}} 
*The Omnitrix has a function that allows the user to stay transformed for an extended period of time without timing out. Ben only knows the lock code for [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]] DNA.<ref name="TFoW2" />
*The Omnitrix has a built-in [[Universal Translator]] and could also translate other Earth languages.<ref name="STDS">''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix had defense mechanisms to protect the host:
**The Omnitrix can generate a blast of Omni-Energy as a defense.<ref name="MI">''[[Mystery, Incorporeal]]''</ref>
**The Omnitrix has a distress signal function and homing device, as Azmuth was able to find and rescue Ben when he was trapped inside the Incursean Exile Pod.<ref name="TFoW2">''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]''</ref>
**The Omnitrix has a failsafe that triggers in the event that the user's life is in jeopardy. This feature turns them into the needed alien to survive.<ref name="AND" />
*The Omnitrix has a security lock system so that it can only be used by an authorized user, as well as an alternate identification program if changes by outside forces occur to said user.<ref name="AD">''[[Arrested Development]]''</ref>
*The Omnitrix has failsafes installed by Azmuth that prevent [[Galvanic Mechamorph (Classic)|Galvanic Mechamorphs]] from tampering with the device.{{Refn|[[:File:Anti-Mechamorph Failsafes.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The Omnitrix can add extras to lifeforms to make them safer and more usable, such as [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]]'s [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]] and [[NRG]]'s [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit|containment suit]].
*With genetic parasites such as [[Skurd]], he can duplicate the DNA of the Omnitrix's aliens and shapeshift their body parts into others'. He can also create armor out of an alien's DNA.
*The Omnitrix can project a flashlight for illumination.<ref name="MM" /><ref>''[[An American Benwolf in London]]''</ref>

